  "notes": "No cross-service ordering or atomic switch is required. The offer.queued payload is unchanged and notifier's additive cap tables coexist with old notifier/customer versions. Deploy notifier one instance at a time; retain queued events and the shared sent data on rollback. The cap is enforced from persisted sent rows, and dropped totals are persisted per customer/day."
